msgid "Remote Storage Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/remote_storage_plugins.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache supports built-in remote storage connectors for Redis, "
"InfiniStore, MooncakeStore, S3, Hugging Face Buckets, and more. The "
"remote storage plugin system provides the ability to add custom storage "
"connectors through dynamic loading. This enables extending remote storage"
" capabilities without modifying core code."
msgstr ""

